l": "PHYS Engine Screen (physical model Koto: Model STRNG, Structure, Brightness, Damping; Body 1/4 pages)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_fm6_screen", "label": "FM6 Engine Screen (six-operator FM, DX7 patches 'Tine EP': ALG, FB, MLVL, MRAT; OPS 1/4 pages)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_sel_layer_screen", "label": "SEL Layer / Key Screen (song key C chromatic, chords on the keys; Chord/Scale/Keys/Transp encoders)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_visualiser_screen", "label": "Visualiser Screen (stereo M/L/R goniometer scatter; HOME on HOME, twelve styles)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_four_encoder_footer", "label": "Four Colour-Coded Encoder Footer (blue/green/yellow/orange knobs mapped to on-screen params)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every screen ends with four knobs whose colours (blue, green, yellow, orange) match the four hardware encoders, so the same physical control layout carries across modes."}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_4x4_key_grid", "label": "4x4 Key Grid UI Pattern (16 pads mirror the 16 hardware keys)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grid/Kit/Steps/Mix/Song/Key screens all render a 4x4 pad grid so the display maps one-to-one onto the device's 16 keys."}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_layer_modes", "label": "Held-Key Layers (SEQ, GLO, SAVE, SEL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Secondary functions are reached by holding a layer key, reusing the 16 keys and 4 encoders for sequencing, global mix, song save and key/chord selection."}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_synth_engine_page_layout", "label": "Synth Engine Page Layout (4 param header + 2x2 large values + page indicator)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PHYS and FM6 share the same layout: status bar (play, tempo, track number, battery), four coloured param headers, enlarged 2x2 value view, and a footer naming engine/preset and page N/4."}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_track_color_coding", "label": "Track Colour Coding (tracks 1-4 = blue, green, yellow, orange)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mute buttons and level knobs on the Mix screen reuse the same four colours as the encoders, tying tracks to colours across the UI."}, {"id": "assets_screens_sloop_screens_parameter_lock", "label": "Per-Step Parameter Lock", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "assets/screens/sloop-screens.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "assets_screens_s